1111
00:41:20,311 --> 00:41:22,180
I'M GONNA CALL ONE NAME.

1112
00:41:22,180 --> 00:41:25,483
WHOEVER'S NAME I DO NOT CALL
MUST IMMEDIATELY

1113
00:41:25,483 --> 00:41:35,126
RETURN TO THE LOFT,
PACK YOUR BELONGINGS AND LEAVE.

1114
00:41:35,126 --> 00:41:37,962
Tyra: SHANDI,
CONGRATULATIONS.

1115
00:41:37,962 --> 00:41:39,063
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING
TOWARDS BECOMING

1116
00:41:39,063 --> 00:41:40,565
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1117
00:41:45,837 --> 00:41:47,171
Tyra: THANK YOU, BETHANY.

1118
00:41:50,208 --> 00:41:53,311
Bethany: I DEFINITELY DIDN'T
THINK I WAS GONNA GO THIS SOON,

1119
00:41:53,311 --> 00:41:54,445
IF AT ALL.

1120
00:41:54,445 --> 00:41:55,613
I KNOW THAT I HAVE
A LOT MORE TALENT

1121
00:41:55,613 --> 00:41:58,649
THAN PROBABLY HALF
OF THESE GIRLS HERE.

1122
00:41:58,649 --> 00:41:59,784
IT'S VERY FRUSTRATING TO ME.

1123
00:41:59,784 --> 00:42:01,753
THIS IS SOMETHING
I REALLY WANTED.

1124
00:42:01,753 --> 00:42:07,458
♪♪♪

1125
00:42:15,400 --> 00:42:17,502
Tyra: STAY TUNED FOR SCENES
FROM OUR NEXT EPISODE.

1126
00:42:21,005 --> 00:42:24,042
HERE'S WHAT'S COMING UP
ON "AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL."

1127
00:42:24,042 --> 00:42:25,843
HEATHER STRUGGLES TO FIT IN.

1128
00:42:25,843 --> 00:42:27,011
Woman: It'll be all right.

1129
00:42:27,011 --> 00:42:29,347
Tyra: AND EVERYBODY
GETS A BRAND-NEW LOOK.

1130
00:42:29,347 --> 00:42:31,783
WE ARE GOING PLATINUM BLONDES.

1131
00:42:31,783 --> 00:42:32,750
YOU LIKE YOUR CUT?

1132
00:42:32,750 --> 00:42:33,718
Yoanna: YES, I LOVE IT.

1133
00:42:33,718 --> 00:42:34,919
Catie: (sobs)

1134
00:42:34,919 --> 00:42:38,056
Tyra: FEAR TAKES CATIE
FOR A RIDE,

1135
00:42:38,056 --> 00:42:39,057
BUT IT'S SHANDI

1136
00:42:39,057 --> 00:42:41,159
WHO CAN'T HANDLE THE PRESSURE.

1137
00:42:41,159 --> 00:42:42,860
Woman: SHANDI, OH, NO!

1138
00:42:47,665 --> 00:42:48,499
You shut up.

